{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16232040","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16232040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1623204001:0":{"text":"아울베어 님, 요즘 숲에 이상한 녀석 둘이 나타났는데요...","source_cn":"枭熊大人，最近森林里来了两个怪家伙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBCB40220503D8F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1623204002:0":{"text":"맞아요! 걔들만 나타나면 무서워서 꼬리가 꼬여버릴 정도예요!","source_cn":"对对对！只要他们一出现，我就吓得尾巴打结！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE97E92B273373E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1623204003:0":{"text":"멍! 맞아요!","source_cn":"汪，是真的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x233D6112843272C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1623204004:0":{"text":"자자, 하나씩 말해. 그 괴상한 녀석들이 어떻게 생겼고, 어디서 나타난 거지?","source_cn":"好了好了，你们一个一个说。你们说的怪家伙，长什么样？在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF74AA7BDC3EFBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1623204005:0":{"text":"걔네요... 하나는 계속 “사사삭” 소리를 내고, 다른 하나는 머리 위에 불이 있어요! 진짜 무서워 죽겠다고요!","source_cn":"他们……一个总是沙沙响，另一个还顶着一团火！吓死个松鼠了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9042CF1F7D007FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1623204006:0":{"text":"처음에는 밀밭 근처에서 나타났는데, 점점 숲으로 들어오려고 하는지 다들 엄청 불안해 해요.","source_cn":"起初是在麦田附近出现的。最近他们似乎想进森林，大家都有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECE1F232B76A4D83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1623204007:1":{"text":"저... 제가 이걸 주웠거든요. “사사삭” 하는 녀석이 떨어뜨린 건데...","source_cn":"我……我捡到这个。是那个沙沙响的家伙掉的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C67FA3DC422318F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:13::2":{"text":"빗자루 솔","source_cn":"笤帚苗","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF38BFF7E50FF3C95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1623204008:0":{"text":"빗자루 솔?","source_cn":"笤帚苗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD32EC27D0C886F74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1623204009:0":{"text":"맞아요, 맞아요! 그래서 다들 아울베어 님한테 물어보러 온 거예요. 아시는 게 많잖아요!","source_cn":"对对！所以大家才想来请教您嘛！您见识最广了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFCE59BA61CAED99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1623204010:0":{"text":"그래, 이 일은 내가 신경 써 보지. 다들 돌아가. 경계는 하지만 너무 호들갑 떨지는 말고.","source_cn":"我知道了。这件事我会留意的，大家先回去吧，保持警惕，但...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2E79C06CEB57B9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1623204011:0":{"text":"언제 해결하러 가실 거예요?","source_cn":"所以枭熊大人你什么时候去解决？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FB6005CA28DFF94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1623204012:0":{"text":"아휴, 아울베어 님이 약속하셨으니까 해주시겠지. 우린 가자!","source_cn":"好啦，枭熊大人答应的事肯定会做的。我们走吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C42F31DB6060350","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1623204013:2":{"text":"멍! 가자!","source_cn":"汪，走吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x020B23CD94000F47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1623204014:0":{"text":"그런데 아울베어 님이 숲에 오신 것도 정말 오랜만이네요. 다들 보고 싶어 했어요!","source_cn":"不过的确好久没见枭熊大人来森林了，动物们都很想念你呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8437A0F5C52695F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1623204015:0":{"text":"시간 내서 가보지.","source_cn":"我会抽时间过去的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14F301A859A8C53F","variant_status":"","male":"","fem